Aggregation function:
```
def aggregate(rows):  # rows: list of (name, s1_verdict_raw, s2_pass)
  out={canonical:[],controls:[],mutants:...}
  for canonical: ok = s1=="pass" and s2=="pass"; verdict FAIL if not ok
  controls similar
  mutants: caught = s1=="fail" or s2=="fail"; structural_caught counts s1 fail; semantic_caught counts s2 fail; union_caught; escapes
  total; note; verdict FAIL if union != total
```

